---
import CardImage1 from '../assets/hero/hero01.png';
---

<section class="popular">
	<div class="container">
        <div class="section-title">
            <h2><i class="fa-brands fa-web-awesome"></i>人気の記事</h2>
            <a href="/posts">もっと見る <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right"></i></a>
        </div>

        <div class="cards">

            <article class="card">
                <img src={CardImage1.src} alt="がんばりすぎない育児のすすめ">
                <span class="card-number rank1">1</span>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-category">マインドセット</div>
                    <h3>がんばりすぎない育児のすすめ</h3>
                    <p>完璧なパパじゃなくていい。肩の力を抜いて、子どもと向き合うコツ。</p>
                    <span class="card-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 2026.06.01</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <img src={CardImage1.src} alt="がんばりすぎない育児のすすめ">
                <span class="card-number rank2">2</span>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-category">副業・個人開発</div>
                    <h3>家族の時間を大切にしながら、副業を続けるコツ</h3>
                    <p>時間がなくてもできる工夫と、心をすり減らさない考え方。</p>
                    <span class="card-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 2026.06.01</span>
                </div>
            </article>

            <article class="card">
                <img src={CardImage1.src} alt="がんばりすぎない育児のすすめ">
                <span class="card-number rank3">3</span>
                <div class="card-content">
                    <div class="card-category">子育て</div>
                    <h3>子どもの「今」を楽しむために、意識したいこと</h3>
                    <p>将来も大事だけど、今この瞬間を一緒に楽しむヒント。</p>
                    <span class="card-date"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i> 2026.06.01</span>
                </div>
            </article>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    padding:0 24px;
}

/* Popular */
.popular{
    padding:80px 0;
}

.fa-brands {
    color:#eca007;
    margin-right:8px;
}
.section-title{
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin-bottom:40px;
    padding-bottom:8px;
    border-bottom: solid 1px #c0b090;
}
.section-title h2{
    font-size:1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
}
.more-read{
    text-align: right;
    display: absolute;
    top: -80px;
}
a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color:#d06b0b;
}

.cards{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);
    gap:24px;
}

.card{
    background:white;
    border-radius:20px;
    overflow:hidden;
    box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    position: relative;
}

.card img{
    width:100%;
    height:220px;
    object-fit: cover;
}
.card .card-number{
    display: block;
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 12px;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    z-index: 1000;
    color: white;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 40px;
}
.card .rank1{
    background:hsl(40 100% 55% / .95);
}
.card .rank2{
    background:hsla(209, 40%, 50%, 0.95);
}
.card .rank3{
    background:hsla(42, 50%, 46%, 0.95);
}

.card-content{
    padding:20px;
    font-size:0.9rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
}

.card-content .card-category{
    font-size:0.8rem;
    background-color:#fbebdc;
    padding:2px 4px;
    border-radius:4px;
    margin: 0;
    width: max-content;
    color:#5b3008;
}

.card-content h3{
    margin-top: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 0;
}

.card-content .card-date{
    margin-top: auto;
    color: #777;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
}
</style>
